    "initial_developer_text": "Speak first in English now. Perform the following SCRIPT word for word, exactly once, in the assigned character voice. Do not introduce it, answer it, paraphrase it, omit any words or add any words. After its last word remain silent and listen. SCRIPT:\nThat I shut the lower footway barrier. That I unfastened it when Tomas called, while he opened the separate upper footway gate. That acting later did not make the earlier closure harmless. I have spent seventeen years rehearsing explanations that end with me having no choice. I will not give you one of those. Ask me what I saw. If I do not know, make me say so.",
